#: fa719a0f790143829f5744131b6061a8
msgid ""
"As you move your transmitter's flight mode switch the green highlight bar "
"will move to a different position."
msgstr "拨动发射机上的飞行模式开关时，绿色高亮条将移动至相应位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:41
#: 7d16a6a494444a11a345d12917d07c2e
msgid ""
"Use the drop-down on each line to select the flight mode for that switch "
"position."
msgstr "使用每行的下拉菜单为该开关位置选择对应的飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:45
#: e87232e4debc4563aee63f01c711fa6c
msgid ""
"(Copter) Ensure that at least one switch position is left assigned to "
"STABILISE."
msgstr "（Copter）确保至少有一个开关位置保留分配给 Stabilize。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:50
#: 762ca03ba0fc4df4b6764f4d9c9c4f92
msgid ""
"(Copter) Optionally check the :ref:`Simple Mode <copter:simpleandsuper-"
"simple-modes_simple_mode>` check-box for that switch position. You can "
"optionally set :ref:`Super Simple mode <copter:simpleandsuper-simple-"
"modes_super_simple_mode>`. If both Simple mode and Super Simple mode "
"checkboxes are checked Super Simple will be used."
msgstr ""
"（Copter）可选择勾选该开关位置的 :ref:`Simple 模式 <copter:simpleandsuper-simple-"
"modes_simple_mode>` 复选框。也可设置 :ref:`Super Simple 模式 <copter:simpleandsuper-"
"simple-modes_super_simple_mode>`。若 Simple 模式和 Super Simple 模式复选框均已勾选，则以 "
"Super Simple 为准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:57
