msgstr "完成后点击 **保存模式** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:60
#: 6b3f3f8a57164f439345c6a4c521566c
msgid ""
"(Copter) Some modes can also be invoked from the :ref:`auxiliary switches "
