#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:82
#: d0ce1d8ed57c4a47a4c5a85f38b3d49d
msgid ""
"The transmitter must emit PWM signals in the correct range to allow us to "
"map a mode to a switch position."
msgstr "发射机必须在正确范围内输出 PWM 信号，以便将模式映射至开关位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst
#: ac9f872055954603bbf00ac6d8c6e868
msgid "Generally the range is between 1000 to 2000 us (1.0 to 2.0 ms)."
msgstr "通常范围为 1000 至 2000 us（1.0 至 2.0 ms）。"

