msgid "Spektrum DX8 (alternate method)"
msgstr "Spektrum DX8（备选方法）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:174
#: 8b2d7e9531f44907a8b2d2360f948330
msgid ""
"This section describes an alternative way to set 6 modes with the Spektrum "
"DX8. This method uses the Gear switch and the Flight mode switch. All the "
"other switches can be assigned as preferred. This method also allows each "
"mode to be set in the middle of each mode's pulse width range so small "
"changes will not change modes. Use Mission Planner Flight Modes setup to "
"monitor the Current PWM for these adjustments."
msgstr ""
"本节介绍使用 Spektrum DX8 设置 6 个模式的备选方法。该方法使用 Gear "
"开关和飞行模式开关，其他开关可按个人喜好分配。此方法还允许将每个模式设置在其脉宽范围的中间，从而使小幅变化不会切换模式。请使用 Mission "
"Planner 飞行模式设置界面监测当前 PWM 值进行调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration.rst:181
#: 235a71c553904472b9f1fa8b930b606f
msgid "Setup the switches (required for the 6 modes)"
msgstr "设置开关（6 个模式所必需）"

