#: 843272c1805440b5832bf7d53d86fba7
msgid ""
"Hold roller bar down, turn on DX8, scroll down to Switch Select, Click "
"roller bar.  Set switches as follows:"
msgstr "按住滚轮，开启 DX8，滚动至「Switch Select」，按下滚轮，按如下方式设置开关："

